{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15304300","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15304300","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1530430001:1":{"text":"아직도 몰라? 진짜 사냥의 신께서 강림하셨으니까!","source_cn":"你还不知道吗？真正的狩猎神降临了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A44A39402B62FE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1530430002:1":{"text":"신께서 강림하셨으니, 보칼리스인이 다시는 신전과 가까운 그림자 영지를 넘보지 못할 거야.","source_cn":"她降临之后，呼临人肯定不敢再进攻离神殿很近的逐影营地了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x043F548E84015F00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1530430003:1":{"text":"아, 맞다. 아이들은? 전쟁을 피해서 분노의 골짜기로 보내야 하지 않을까?","source_cn":"对了，那孩子们呢？还要不要把他们送往树怒山谷，免得战火...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C5F9FC4FC771B59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1530430004:1":{"text":"그럴 필요는 없을 거야. 내 생각엔 분노의 골짜기보다 그림자 영지가 더 안전할 것 같아.","source_cn":"应该没这个必要了吧。要我说，逐影营地现在比树怒山谷更安全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C62023CCC21298B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:无尾":{"text":"테일리스","source":"无尾","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:闪":{"text":"플래시","source":"闪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}